{"id":"68f172d58c15e75d","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-consistency-statement.md","title":"Internal Consistency Statement","display":"df-consistency-statement — Internal Consistency Statement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-consistency-statement","aliases":["92-df-consistency-statement"],"display":"df-consistency-statement — Internal Consistency Statement","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）","source_status":"原书一致性句的本地实例"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-consistency-statement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-consistency-statement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-statement — Internal Consistency Statement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书一致性句的本地实例"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-consistency-statement-—-Consistency-Statement-$\\mathrm{Con}_G$\">df-consistency-statement — Consistency Statement <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (definition-target consistency sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> (fixed contradiction sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_G\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_G\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的对象语言一致性句</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> : 本书固定的矛盾句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S(0)\">\\(0=S(0)\\)</span></li>\n<li>一致性陈述断言&quot;矛盾不可证&quot;</li>\n<li>这是第二不完备性定理的对象</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>语言中的句子；外部元语言一致性写作<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>与外部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>的一致，需要所选内部证明公式在标准模型中正确表示外部证明关系；二者不能仅凭相同名称互换</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书允许选任意可反驳句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，定义 consis 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg P(\\overline{\\ulcorner f\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg P(\\overline{\\ulcorner f\\urcorner})\\)</span>；这里选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S(0)\">\\(0=S(0)\\)</span>。HBL 支撑该句不可证，证明谓词的标准模型正确性支撑它语义上表达真实一致性。两类条件在修订后的证明公式选择中分别声明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-consistency-statement-—-Consistency-Statement-$\\mathrm{Con}_G$","text":"df-consistency-statement — Consistency Statement $\\mathrm{Con}_G$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin